{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、みんなで、せーーーの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「可憐な輝きを放つ少女よー！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はーい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/02/14/%E3%81%AE%E3%81%86%E3%81%98%E3%82%87%E3%81%86.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちら乃木坂新制服。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マーガレット学園にいそうな雰囲気でしょ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"挨拶はもちろんごきげんよう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そもそもマーガレット学園ってどこから出てきたんだよって思うでしょ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこはほら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雰囲気で感じとってよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/02/14/%E3%81%AE%E3%81%86%E3%81%98%E3%82%87%E3%81%86%EF%BC%91.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、幕張コンサートにむけてのリハでした (๑╹∀╹๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わっくわくだねみんなぁ！！！❤❤❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までやったライブの会場の中でいっっちばん大きいんだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/02/14/6782559/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだか照れるね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早くあの会場で思いっきり走りまわってみたいの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん？もちろんエリマキトカゲで。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな笑っちゃダメだよ、あみが通ったら拍手しなきゃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー楽しみ楽しみ(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャラララ♪素敵にキッス♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年はそうですね懐かしい、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"国生さゆりさんとバレンタインキッスを歌わせていただきました❤❤❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女子の皆さんは今頃バレンタインのチョコレート作りに真っ最中かな？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/02/14/6782559/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな人のため、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達のため、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族のため...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんながそれぞれの人への思いを込めて作ってるって素敵ね❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみはねー、ちゃんと手作りで作ってるよ～↷꒰ू´•௰ू• `꒱↷ ❤❤❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーのためにね  (๑･ิټ･ิ๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもねえ、なんだか肉団子みたいなのがちらほら見え隠れしてるけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"味には問題ないよ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よーしそれじゃあ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥には特別に私のメガネをあげよう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/02/14/6782559/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んちゃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/02/14/6782559/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみがみんなにチョコレートあげたろかー❤❤❤"}],"source":"archive"}